  enforceMaxStress: 0
  maxAllowedStress: 100
  isTimeAttack: 0
  timeAttackDuration: 60
  winCondition: 0
  requiredIntactTime: 5
  goldReward: 250
  expReward: 75
  offerDialogue:
    name: Vance
    sentences:
    - Another engineer assembled this crossing, but some of its joints are out of
      position.
    - I do not need you to add more material or tear the bridge apart. I need you
      to realign what is already there.
    - Use <b><#E09500>Move</color></b> to reposition the existing joints, then watch
      how the bridge carries the test vehicle.
    - You can use <b><#E09500>Undo, Redo, and Simulate</color></b> while you work.
      Find an alignment that keeps a safe path across.
    - Will you inspect and correct this bridge?
  continueOfferDialogue:
    name: Vance
    sentences:
    - The bridge is already in place. Turn on Move, then drag a joint that needs
      adjustment.
    - You cannot add or erase members on this job. Test the new alignment before
      you finish.
  reminderDialogue:
    name: Vance
    sentences:
    - Reposition the existing joints with Move and keep the roadway connected.
    - Use Undo if an adjustment makes the crossing worse, then simulate again.
  finishedContractDialogue:
    name: Vance
    sentences:
    - The vehicle crossed safely with the bridge in its new alignment.
    - Careful placement can matter as much as adding material. Good work, {PlayerName}.
